{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Its pouring</b> — on account of fire and cloud." "<b>Your arrows</b> — they are the lightnings, and this is in the pillar of fire, for עבות is like 'in a cloud'." "And the word זורמו — on the pattern of כי גורשו ממצרים." "And some say: from the root זרם, or according to the sense of the matter, <b>your arrows</b> — like the form of falling fire whose scent spreads."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 77, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:51.617769124Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}